[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016153060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108062#issuecomment-3016153060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108062","id":3016153060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zxtfk","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-28T23:42:43Z","updated_at":"2025-06-28T23:50:56Z","body":"- `NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED` is specific to `CanvasItem`/`Node3D`;\n- There is no inheritance relationship between `EditorPlugin` and `CanvasItem`/`Node3D`;\n\nSo `EditorPlugin`'s `_notification()` will not receive notifications of type `NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED`. This is as expected.\n\nNot sure about your specific intention, maybe you can try to listen indirectly through the `history_changed` signal of `EditorUndoRedoManager`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016153060/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016937603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108062#issuecomment-3016937603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108062","id":3016937603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6z0tCD","user":{"login":"wyattbiker","id":930478,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDQ3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker","html_url":"https://github.com/wyattbiker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-29T18:08:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-29T18:08:01Z","body":"My intention is to detect when a selected node in the 3D Editor has been transformed by the gizmo. So does the 3D editor send any notification when the transform is changed? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016937603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3017209735","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108062#issuecomment-3017209735","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108062","id":3017209735,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6z1veH","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-29T22:34:08Z","updated_at":"2025-06-29T22:40:40Z","body":"> My intention is to detect when a selected node in the 3D Editor has been transformed by the gizmo. So does the 3D editor send any notification when the transform is changed?\n\nYou may not understand the notification mechanism. It is usually received by the object that needs to handle a certain notification (in most cases, a sender and receiver is itself or a closely related object). Your intention is to listen (from other objects). The related concept is **signal**. Unfortunately, there is no directly related signal. But you can listen to the user's operation by listening to `history_changed` of `EditorUndoRedoManager`. However, the methods for obtaining relevant information are not exposed enough, so you need more work.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3017209735/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3017643109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108062#issuecomment-3017643109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108062","id":3017643109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6z3ZRl","user":{"login":"wyattbiker","id":930478,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDQ3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker","html_url":"https://github.com/wyattbiker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-30T03:26:47Z","updated_at":"2025-06-30T03:26:47Z","body":"Thank you for the clarification. I will go ahead and close this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3017643109/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]